  "slug": "big-batch-spiked-arnold-palmers-recipe-11733281",
  "name": "Big Batch Spiked Arnold Palmers",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This big batch of spiked Arnold Palmers is the best answer to a hot summer afternoon. Beat the heat with a ready batch of sweet tea, lemonade, and bourbon to serve over ice waiting in the refrigerator.",
  "cuisine": "African American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine sweet tea, lemonade, and bourbon in a 1-gallon jug. Seal the jug and carefully tilt it upside down a couple time to mix the ingredients. Refrigerate until ready to serve; serve over ice."
    }
  ],
